-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.0 (2026-10-14)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First version: games, dialout, plugdev, audio, video, bluetooth, netdev, lpadmin, scanner, kvm, libvirt, render and
    sambashare for every new desktop user (Daniel, 2026-10-10)
  * One list, /etc/sparky-stereo/user-groups, feeds adduser.conf (adduser and System Settings' Users page) and the
    installer's users.conf (generated from the calamares package's file, regenerated by a dpkg trigger)
  * Refuses root-equivalent and keystroke-reading groups (docker, disk, input, shadow, sudo and more)
  * propose lists what existing users lack and changes nothing
